  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnershipprogr East Eur</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Partnerskapsprogrammet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Partnerskapsprogrammet syftar till att i ut&#xF6;kad utstr&#xE4;ckning engagera EU:s nyaste medlemsstater som samarbetspartners och genomf&#xF6;rare i svenskt utvecklingssamarbete i &#xD6;steuropa. Partnerskapsprogrammet &#xE4;r en s&#xE4;rskild satsning under tre &#xE5;r f&#xF6;r att utveckla metodologin samt ing&#xE5;ngs&#xE4;tta samarbeten med nya medlemsstater i EU.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The partnership Programme aims att engaging the EU&apos;s newest member states in Swedish development cooperation with the countries in Eastern Europe. The programme is a special effort that will, during 3 years, develop the methodology for such cooperation as well as assist in initiating joint development projects with the EU&apos;s newst member states.</narrative>
  </description>
